  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t44_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -324
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Accumulator: fold within a ForEach\n\nThe split Read / Write pair lets you fold a spread without ever drawing a back-edge wire. Drop **AccRead** on the left of the region (it emits the running value via `read`) and **AccWrite** on the right (its `write` input becomes the next iteration's read; its `final` output is the last value once the loop ends). The pair is matched by `slot`.\n\nHere we sum 1..10 by accumulating an integer — every wire flows left to right.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 260
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Accumulator: fold within a ForEach\n\nThe split Read / Write pair lets you fold a spread without ever drawing a back-edge wire. Drop **AccRead** on the left of the region (it emits the running value via `read`) and **AccWrite** on the right (its `write` input becomes the next iteration's read; its `final` output is the last value once the loop ends). The pair is matched by `slot`.\n\nHere we sum 1..10 by accumulating an integer — every wire flows left to right.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 260
      }
    },
